  "live_records": {
    "q-82999": {
      "dom_id": "step-q82999",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Simplify the following sentence: \"The bike is blue or the bike is green, or the bike is green and it is a green bike.\"",
      "worked_solution": "First, we simplify the phrase \"the bike is green and it is a green bike\" to just \"the bike is green.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The bike is blue or the bike is green, or the bike is green.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma in the sentence:\n\n\"The bike is blue, or the bike is green or the bike is green.\"\n\nNow, we simplify the phrase \"the bike is green or the bike is green\" to just \"the bike is green.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"the bike is blue or the bike is green.\"\n\nFinally, we simplify the sentence to\n\n\"The bike is blue or green.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The bike is blue but not green",
              "html": "The bike is blue but not green"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The bike is blue",
              "html": "The bike is blue "
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The bike is blue or green",
              "html": "The bike is blue or green"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The bike is blue and green",
              "html": "The bike is blue and green"
            },
            {
              "option": "e",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-e",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The bike is green",
              "html": "The bike is green"
            }
          ],
          "choices_complete": true
        }
      ],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": true,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-q82999\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 1</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Simplify the following sentence: \"The bike is blue or the bike is green, or the bike is green and it is a green bike.\"</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The bike is blue but not green</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The bike is blue </td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The bike is blue or green</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The bike is blue and green</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82999-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The bike is green</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p></p><p>First, we simplify the phrase \"the bike is green and it is a green bike\" to just \"the bike is green.\" The sentence now reads</p><p></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The bike is blue or the bike is green, or the bike is green.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then, using the associative law, we can move the comma in the sentence:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The bike is blue, or the bike is green or the bike is green.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Now, we simplify the phrase \"the bike is green or the bike is green\" to just \"the bike is green.\" The sentence now reads</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"the bike is blue or the bike is green.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Finally, we simplify the sentence to</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The bike is blue or green.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>",
