    "q-82995": {
      "dom_id": "step-q82995",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Simplify the sentence \"The house is pretty, or it is pretty or white.\"",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's rewrite the phrase \"it is pretty or white\" as the equivalent phrase \"it is pretty or it is white.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The house is pretty, or it is pretty or it is white.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma:\n\n\"The house is pretty or it is pretty, or it is white.\"\n\nNow, we can simplify the phrase \"the house is pretty or it is pretty\" to just \"the house is pretty.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The house is pretty, or it is white.\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely as\n\n\"The house is pretty or white.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
