      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Simplify $P∧((P∧Q)∧Q).$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the associative and idempotent laws, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P∧((P∧Q)∧Q) & ≡P∧(P∧(Q∧Q)) \\\\  & ≡P∧(P∧Q) \\\\  & ≡(P∧P)∧Q \\\\  & ≡P∧Q.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
